NOTE ON THE DISPLAY FONT

This licence covers the source code in this repository only. It does not cover
the Anurati typeface, which is deliberately not included here: Anurati is by
Emmeran Richard and is licensed for personal use only, so redistributing it
would not be permitted. Each user downloads it themselves into fonts/. Without
it the day banner falls back to Century Gothic and the software still works.

Commercial use of Anurati requires the paid release:
https://www.emmeranrichard.fr/foundry/anurati-pro/
